  "flow": [
    "Attract screen: tap anywhere ('화면을 터치해 주문을 시작하세요')",
    "Dine-in / take-out choice: '매장에서 먹어요' or '포장해 갈게요' (prices do not change)",
    "Menu screen: 6 category tabs, 3-column item grid, cart panel at the bottom (per-line − qty + and ✕, '전체삭제', '총 N개 total', '주문하기')",
    "Item option popup (only for items that have option groups): option groups, '수량' stepper, '취소' / '<line price> 담기'. Items without option groups go straight into the cart on tap",
    "Order review '주문 내역을 확인해 주세요': lines, dine-in/take-out, '총 결제금액'; '결제하기' opens the confirmation '총 N원을 결제할까요?' ('다시 확인' / '결제하기')",
    "Payment-method screen '결제 수단을 선택해 주세요': '결제하실 금액' and 3 methods (신용·체크카드, QR 간편결제, 모바일 상품권); picking one only shows a guide line. End of flow"
