  "quirks": [
    "Menu cards show the HOT/base price. The ICED +500원 surcharge appears only inside the option popup, and only for drinks using group tempUp (카페라떼, 바닐라빈 라떼, 카라멜 마키아토, 카페모카, 초코라떼, 녹차라떼, 흑임자 라떼, 유자차, 자몽차, 로열 밀크티). Drinks using group temp (아메리카노, 카푸치노, 고구마라떼, 캐모마일, 페퍼민트, 얼그레이) have no surcharge.",
    "HOT/ICED has no default. Tapping '담기' without it shows the error '온도(HOT/ICED)를 선택해 주세요.'",
    "'얼음 양' (적게/보통/많이, default 보통) appears only after ICED is selected. Switching back to HOT hides it; selecting ICED again resets it to 보통.",
    "ICE ONLY items (콜드브루, 레몬에이드, 딸기라떼) have ICED pre-selected as the only temperature choice, so '얼음 양' is visible immediately.",
    "에스프레소 is HOT ONLY: it has no temperature group, only '샷 추가'.",
    "'샷 추가' is a − 0 + stepper (+500원 per shot, max 3). Pressing + at 3 shows '샷 추가는 최대 3회까지 가능해요.' The popup also has a separate '수량' stepper for the line quantity.",
    "Syrups are multi-select, max 2. A third tap shows '시럽은 최대 2개까지 선택할 수 있어요.' and is not selected; tapping a selected syrup deselects it. 흑당 시럽 is +700원, the others +500원.",
    "'우유 선택' and '데우기' are pre-selected (일반 우유 / 그대로 주세요). 오트 밀크 +600원, 두유 +500원, 저지방 우유 free.",
    "Items without option groups (단팥빵, 마늘 바게트, 소보로빵, 우유식빵, every cake, 에그마요 샌드위치, 리코타 샐러드 샌드위치) are added to the cart immediately on tap with a toast; every further tap adds 1 more.",
    "Adding the same item with the same options merges into the existing cart line (quantities add up). Max 9 per line.",
    "In the cart, − is disabled at quantity 1 (it never deletes); ✕ deletes the line immediately without confirmation; '전체삭제' asks '장바구니를 모두 비울까요?'.",
    "Sold out: 딸기라떼, 앙버터, 티라미수. Cards are greyed with a '품절' stamp; tapping shows a popup and nothing is added.",
    "Inactivity warning uses a fixed fake timer, not real time: right after the 12th counted tap of an order (the attract-screen tap and taps inside the warning are not counted; taps on empty areas are counted), the modal '계속 주문하시겠어요?' opens once per order on top of whatever is showing, with '30초'. It never counts down by itself. Each tap on the dark backdrop outside the box costs 10 fake seconds; at 0 the order is discarded and the attract screen shows '입력이 없어 주문이 취소되었습니다.' '계속 주문하기' keeps everything; the modal's '처음으로' discards the order without asking.",
    "The header '처음으로' asks '주문을 취소하고 처음 화면으로 돌아갈까요?' before discarding.",
    "'결제하기' appears twice in a row: the review screen button and the confirmation button.",
    "Text merges in the DOM: a menu card's text is like '☕아메리카노3,800원', an option chip 'ICED+500원', the add button '5,800원 담기'.",
    "Category tabs, menu cards, option chips, '주문하기', '처음으로', '메뉴 추가하기', '이전' and payment methods are clickable divs; steppers, ✕, '전체삭제', '담기', '취소', '결제하기' and dialog buttons are real buttons."
